{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"allServers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit30\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit30\/OpenAPI","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"OpenAPI","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OpenAPIKit300A3APIO"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit30\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit30\/OpenAPI\/Server","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Server","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OpenAPIKit300A3APIO6ServerV"},{"kind":"text","text":"] { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This property contains all servers defined at any level the document"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and therefore may or may not contain servers not found in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"root servers array."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"servers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property on ","type":"text"},{"code":"OpenAPI.Document","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", by contrast, contains","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"servers that are applicable to all paths and operations that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"do not define their own ","type":"text"},{"code":"serves","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" array to override the root array.","type":"text"}]},{"name":"Important","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For the purposes of returning one of each "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Server"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"two servers are considered identical if they have the same "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"url"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"variables"},{"type":"text","text":". Differing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"description"},{"type":"text","text":" properties for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise identical servers are considered to be two ways to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"describe the same server. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vendorExtensions"},{"type":"text","text":" are also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored when determining server uniqueness."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The first "},{"code":"Server","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" encountered will be used, so if the only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"difference between a server at the root document level and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one in an "},{"code":"Operation","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s override of the servers array is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"description, the description of the "},{"code":"Server","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" returned by this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property will be that of the root document definition."}]}],"style":"important"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit30\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit30\/OpenAPI\/Document\/allServers"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"All servers referenced anywhere in the whole document."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit30\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit30","doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit30\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit30\/OpenAPI","doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit30\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit30\/OpenAPI\/Document"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openapikit30\/openapi\/document\/allservers"]}],"me